            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EPH.6.21+EPH.6.22"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Eph 6.21-22",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Tychicus will tell you all about my affairs; he is a beloved brother and faithful minister and fellow servant in the Lord. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.4.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.4.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 4:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I have sent him to you for this very purpose, that you may know how we are and that he may encourage your hearts, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.4.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.4.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 4:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PHM.1.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Philem 10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " and with him Onesimus, the faithful and beloved brother, who is one of yourselves. They will tell you of everything that has taken place here.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.4.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.4.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
